# PHPUnit MockBuilder (dual PHPUnit versions)

Travis: PHP 7.4 → locked **PHPUnit 7**; PHP 8.5 → **PHPUnit 9.6**.

When mocking with `getMockBuilder()`:

```php
// GOOD — works on PHPUnit 7 and 9.6
->setMethods( array( 'get_all' ) )

// BAD — PHPUnit 8+ only; fatals on the 7.4 Travis job
->onlyMethods( array( 'get_all' ) )
->addMethods( array( 'get_all' ) )
```

Match existing suite usage in `tests/admin/test-class-boldgrid-backup-admin-auto-updates.php` and `tests/admin/test-class-boldgrid-backup-admin-db-import.php`.
